components.responsibility:
Replaces home.go (git mv). pageData moves here unchanged and gains a Next string field and a SignInNext() method, which returns Next, or "/" when Next is empty.

home:
- calls Library.Latest;
- found: the reader page;
- ErrNotFound: 200, empty state 'No reports yet', no iframe;
- any other error: logged, then the unavailable state at 503.

readReport:
- calls PublishedBySlug(r.PathValue("slug"));
- found: the reader page;
- ErrNotFound: http.NotFound, before any header is set;
- any other error: logged, unavailable state at 503.

renderReader(w, r, status, readerData):
- the only path either page takes;
- builds readerData{pageData{Title, SignedIn, Viewer, Next}, Report, HasReport, Unavailable};
- Title is rep.Title+" - hband" on both pages ("hband" when there is no report);
- Next is "/" for the home page and "/reports/"+rep.Slug from the STORED slug for a report page, never from the request;
- sets Cache-Control 'private, no-cache', then calls a.render(w, status, "report.html", d).

readRaw sits beside serveRaw and rawCSP:
- calls OpenRaw(r.Context(), r.PathValue("slug"), true);
- ErrNotFound: http.NotFound, before any report header is set, so the 404 keeps the site CSP with frame-ancestors 'none';
- any other error, including a published row whose file is gone: logged, 500 'internal error' (adminRaw's pattern);
- otherwise serveRaw(w, r, rep, f, "no-cache").
It reads no identity and sets no cookie.

One page for / and /reports/<slug>. home.html is deleted. It uses {{template "head"}} and {{template "header"}}, then <main class="reader">.

With HasReport:
- <h1>{{.Report.Title}}</h1>;
- 'Published {{.Report.PublishedAt.Format "2 January 2006"}}';
- a permalink <a href="/reports/{{.Report.Slug}}">, present on BOTH pages so they stay byte-identical;
- exactly <iframe class="report-frame" sandbox="allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="/raw/{{.Report.Slug}}" title="{{.Report.Title}}" width="100%" height="800"></iframe>.

Empty: <p>No reports yet.</p>, no iframe.

Unavailable: <p>Reports cannot be shown right now. Try again in a moment.</p>, no iframe and no 'No reports yet'.

The template never names any other report and never carries data-hband-admin.

