contracts.notes:
Exactly sandbox="allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="/raw/<slug>", sized by class report-frame plus width and height attributes.

Link behaviour, all measured by the spike framed-report-links-still-work:
- #fragment links scroll the frame;
- target=_blank links open a new unsandboxed tab;
- target-less links to another document are blocked, by the parent's frame-src 'self' for other origins and by siteCSP's frame-ancestors 'none' for site pages, and stay blocked on purpose.
The author adds target=_blank, and the upload form says so.

key_decisions.decision:
Three fitness tripwires, each with fire and quiet corpus rows:
- report bytes are written only by serveRaw;
- no template frames with allow-scripts, allow-same-origin, allow-top-navigation or allow-forms, and no template uses srcdoc;
- only the gated admin calls the draft-returning library methods.

